    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="e39ca39e-8ddd-5da0-ad44-3a0000179259" activityNameId="7f663e56-f3f2-59f3-8480-12504e7dfc38" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Crude oil, at production onshore</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Crude oil, at production onshore
The onshore oil production delivers the product crude oil. The values are derived from a multioutput-process "combined onshore gas and oil production" by allocation based on heating values for crude oil and natural gas UUID=6fd01b1d-9a58-3ae4-8be9-e70ea618442f
Production of crude oil including energy use, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: Data valid for DZ.
Technology: 0 % offshore and  100 % onshore production
Time period: Time of most relevant publications and statistics. Other generic data, e.g. for infrastructure are based on older publications.
Production volume: 60 megatons of crude oil per year in 2023.
Sampling: Statistics and use of generic data
Extrapolations: A part of the data has been estimated with generic assumptions for onshore production.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_6fd01b1d-9a58-3ae4-8be9-e70ea618442f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="7ad1073c-4cae-5ca6-a615-6a3ea9360dee" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
